1
00:00:00,483 --> 00:00:02,053
(Penny:)Get in the car. Come on.

2
00:00:04,721 --> 00:00:06,701
(Stuart(on phone):)All right, thanks a lot.

3
00:00:07,457 --> 00:00:08,997
(Stuart(on phone):)They have one at Capital Comics.

4
00:00:09,158 --> 00:00:12,838
(Bernadette:)-That's great.
-No, its not. I hate that place.

5
00:00:12,996 --> 00:00:14,836
(Stuart:)Guy who owns it is a jerk.

6
00:00:14,998 --> 00:00:16,838
(Stuart:)He's always making me
feel bad about myself.

7
00:00:17,000 --> 00:00:19,000
(Bernadette:)That's terrible.

8
00:00:19,736 --> 00:00:21,406
(Bernadette:)What's the address?

9
00:00:22,872 --> 00:00:23,972
(Stuart:)You know, why don't I
just take you there?

10
00:00:24,140 --> 00:00:25,710
(Stuart:)That way, I can make sure
he doesn't rip you off.

11
00:00:25,875 --> 00:00:27,715
(Bernadette:)Thanks, but I don't
want you to close up.

12
00:00:27,877 --> 00:00:29,917
(Bernadette:)I mean, won't you lose business?

13
00:00:32,682 --> 00:00:34,752
(Bernadette:)Sorry. That was mean.

14
00:00:38,087 --> 00:00:39,687
(Amy:)Penny really quit
The Cheesecake Factory?

15
00:00:39,856 --> 00:00:41,896
(Penny:)-Yeah.
-So what is she doing today?

16
00:00:42,058 --> 00:00:44,198
(Leonard:)I don't know. She already
thinks I don't support this,

17
00:00:44,360 --> 00:00:46,770
(Leonard:)so if I call, it might look like
I'm checking up on her.

18
00:00:46,929 --> 00:00:49,069
(Raj:)-Well, do you support this?
-of course I do.

19
00:00:49,232 --> 00:00:52,442
(Leonard:)She's a great actress.
I'm proud she's taking this risk.

20
00:00:52,602 --> 00:00:58,022
(Amy:)-That's nice.
-You bought that? Great!

